OL,5,G1100 The Man from the Alamo
OL,6,     F(1953) Bud Boetticher's western
OL,7,     Fstars Glenn Ford. A man is branded
OL,8,     Fa coward when he can't prove he
OL,9,     Fwas ordered to abandon his defence
OL,10,     Fof the Alamo. But he gets a chance
OL,11,     Fto redeem himself.
OL,12,G1240 Gunman's Walk
OL,13,     F(1958) Western. Van Heflin stars
OL,14,     Fas a veteran frontiersman whose
OL,15,     Fdetermination to mould his sons in
OL,16,     Fhis gun-totin' image backfires
OL,17,     Fdisastrously. With Tab Hunter and
OL,18,     FJames Darren.
